{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52628","headline":"奉使蒲州返辔奉答圣制（题拟） · 姚崇","name":"奉使蒲州返辔奉答圣制（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归来朝帝□，忽□（疑爲「逢」字）钧天响。\n悬知滻水游，绝胜汾川赏。\n（见前书同卷高宗《过栖岩寺》附刻韦元晨《六绝纪文》引）（按：此诗爲「大周长安二年」作，诗题据韦文拟。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚崇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}